      "inputTokens": 113,
      "outputTokens": 767,
      "costUsd": 0.0069595,
      "pronunciationText": "Every problem in this video uses the same model, so check its conditions first. Does the account start at zero, with a positive interest rate? Are the payments equal, and made at the end of each period? Do r and n match how often the payments are made? Is the future value read at the end of a period, straight after a payment? And what does the question want at the end: rounding to the cent, a whole number of periods, or more growth after the payments stop? This video solves one problem for each of those conditions."
